<title>UK: Ramco Energy first half profits advance.</title>
<headline>Ramco Energy first half profits advance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.91		   vs 2.16</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     0.85		   vs 0.61</p>
<p> Turnover		   4.2		    vs 3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Oil exploration firm Ramco Energy Plc said it would continue its established policy of not paying an interim dividend.</p>
</text>
